GLM-5.3-Flash (native FP8) on a DGX Station GB300 with an RTX PRO 6000 sidecar
==============================================================================

This recipe is part of dgx-station-recipes (MIT; see ../LICENSE). Copyright 2026 Tomas Cupr, except the files
listed below as included from deepseek-v4.1-flash or adapted from vLLM, which keep their authors' copyright.

Its design is Garner McCloud's, from ../deepseek-v4.1-flash: hot experts on the GB300, cold experts computed on the
RTX PRO 6000 by a sidecar, chosen by a static rowmap built from measured route counts; and the recipe's layout (CLI,
README, RESULTS, LIMITATIONS, NOTICE, verify). Credit for that design belongs to him; mistakes in this port are ours.


